## SETUP.md GitHub MCP requirement
97:**GitHub MCP (preferred):** Workflow Cloud Agents should have **GitHub MCP** enabled in the Cursor dashboard (HTTP MCP → `https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/`). Agents post human-visible comments and set labels immediately via MCP; see [MCP-GITHUB.md](MCP-GITHUB.md). When MCP is unavailable, labels and the **status comment** are still synced by GitHub Actions on **every push** to `cursor/issue-*` branches. Create all labels in the table in [WORKFLOW.md](WORKFLOW.md) (including `cursor:*-in-progress`).
